  "synopsis": "Shrek is a lonely green ogre who lives alone in a swamp. One day, his swamp is filled with numerous fairy tale creatures, among them a talking Donkey. From the creatures, he learns that they were driven here by Lord Farquaad. Shrek wants to go to him to negotiate the removal of the creatures to another place. The Donkey will show him the way, as the others have refused. He is too talkative, but Shrek has no other option. When Shrek reaches Farquaad, he promises to clear the swamp, but in return, Shrek must rescue Princess Fiona from a castle guarded by a dragon. Shrek agrees and sets off with the donkey to the castle. Shrek will have to learn about the princess's secrets, which will drastically change his life.",
